{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]}],"metadata":{"title":"value","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL6MXLKeyV6OctaveV5valueSivp","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"value","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlkey\/octave-swift.struct\/value"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey\/Octave-swift.struct\/value"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey\/Octave-swift.struct"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLKey/Octave-swift.struct":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlkey\/octave-swift.struct","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey\/Octave-swift.struct","title":"MXLKey.Octave","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Octave","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The key-octave type specifies in which octave an element of a key signature appears. The content specifies the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"octave value using the same values as the display-octave element. The number attribute is a positive integer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that refers to the key signature element in left-to-right order. If the cancel attribute is set to yes, then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this number refers to the canceling key signature specified by the cancel element in the parent key element.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The cancel attribute cannot be set to yes if there is no corresponding cancel element within the parent key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element. It is no by default.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Octave","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLKey":{"title":"MXLKey","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlkey","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The key type represents a key signature. Both traditional and non-traditional key signatures are supported."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The optional number attribute refers to staff numbers. If absent, the key signature applies to all staves in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the part. Key signatures appear at the start of each system unless the print-object attribute has been set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“no”."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLKey","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLKey","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLKey/Octave-swift.struct/value":{"abstract":[{"text":"The value of this element.","type":"text"}],"title":"value","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlkey\/octave-swift.struct\/value","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":